From: MrlingXD <90316914+wling-art@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:09:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Avoid allocating a path recomputation midpoint

Pass the midpoint coordinates directly to the distance check. Retain the
empty path check and square the distance as a double, including for paths
long enough to overflow an int square.

Ported from Lophine (GPLv3 for its changes; see licenses/GPL.md):
https://github.com/LophineLabs/Lophine/blob/7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02/lophine-server/minecraft-patches/features/0145-Leaf-Avoid-allocating-a-path-recomputation-midpoint.patch
